incrust(1) ["Incrust 0.0.1" ["Incrust Manual"]]

# Name

Incrust - A minimal incremental / idle terminal game

# DESCRIPTION

Run `incrust` to start the game.

Then type 'help' to see the list of available commands.

# SYNOPSIS

*incrust* [OPTION]

# OPTIONS

*-V, --version*
	Display version information.

*-h, --help*
	Display the help message.

# EXIT STATUS

*0* Ok.

*1* Failed to create or acquire the lockfile.

*2* Failed to create or read the statefile.

*3* Failed to read user's command.

# BUGS

Please report bugs to the GitHub page: https://github.com/Antiz96/incrust

